[h1]琉焰卿的永恒轮回 — CK3 Roguelite / New Game+[/h1]
[h3][i]……我将永不停歇地，一次次回到那个你还在的冬日[/i][/h3]
[h3][i]...I shall never cease to return, again and again, to that winter day where you still dwell.[/i][/h3]

[b]一位统治者，一条命，一次结算。死亡称量真实分数；余烬位阶跨存档保存；下一世花费其副本换取强化。[/b]
[b]One ruler, one life, one settlement. Death yields an exact score; the Ember Tier persists across saves; the next life spends its copy on upgrades.[/b]

Version 1.0.2 · CK3 1.20.0.3 · Workshop 3784706360

[b]1.0.2 为待发布候选；公开版仍为 1.0.1，完整验收与上传尚未完成。/ 1.0.2 is pending acceptance and publication; the public version remains 1.0.1.[/b]

[b]⚠ 必须开启教程 / TUTORIAL REQUIRED：设置 → 教程选择「完整」或「警告」，切勿禁用。旧纪录仍可读取，但禁用后新余烬位阶、契约 PB 与图鉴不会落盘。[/b]

[h1]1.0.2 新版适配 / CK3 1.20 Maintenance[/h1]
廷臣目录更新为 226 项原生特质。信仰选择显示并绑定礼仪：同信仰保留玩家礼仪，其他信仰使用主礼仪；旧配置缺失或不匹配的礼仪自动补齐。继承窗保留新版教会选项，九语帮助同步。
The catalog now has 226 native traits. Faith selection displays and binds your current Rite for your faith, or another faith's main Rite; missing or mismatched saved Rites are repaired. The succession window keeps new ecclesiastical choices; help is updated in nine languages.

[h1]1.0.1 性能与终局改进 / Performance & Finale[/h1]
开局按需扫描 700 档教程纪录，生日契约提前过滤无关角色；死亡先同步完整结算再写纪录，并使用专属终幕画面。计分、奖池、商店、契约和持久化均保留。
Import scans the 700 tutorial tiers only when requested at game start; birthday contracts filter irrelevant characters. Death publishes a complete snapshot before writing records, with dedicated finale art. Scoring, pools, shop, contracts and persistence remain intact.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/01_pact.jpg[/img]

[h1]核心循环 / Core Loop[/h1]

[h3]跨世余烬与轮回当铺 / Ember Tier & Reincarnation Shop[/h3]
绝对/本世成长计分，0/25/50/100% 无上限继承；推荐成长 + 100%。四页当铺提供属性、资源、借命、重抽、封印、恐怖值、正统性、暴政修正、免费宗教改革及 10000/50000/100000 分批量强化；余分等量转金币。
Choose Absolute or Lifetime Growth scoring and 0/25/50/100% inheritance. Four shop pages offer attributes, resources, Health, rerolls, seals, dread, legitimacy, tyranny relief, faith reformation and bulk upgrades; leftover points become gold.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/02_reincarnation_shop.jpg[/img]

[h3]一份祝福，一道咒痕 / One Blessing, One Curse[/h3]
开局及每三年，选带稀有度/构筑标签的三项祝福之一，再强制选两项诅咒之一。每场一对；重抽换祝福，封印免咒痕，拒绝整场使最终分数 -1%。
At start and every three years, choose one of three tagged blessings and one of two mandatory curses. Rerolls replace blessings, seals waive curses, and declining costs 1% final score.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/03_blessing_choice.jpg[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/04_curse_choice.jpg[/img]

[h3]账簿与本世契约 / Ledger & Lifetime Contracts[/h3]
原生决议打开只读账簿：即时分数、历史/候选/下一位阶、差值、交易对数与拒绝次数。征服者、织网者、圣徒、家主、贤王、享乐者六类契约，在 3/6/10 进度提供反馈、分数和跨存档 PB。
The Decisions ledger shows live score, historical/candidate/next tiers, gap, pairs and refusals. Six contracts cover warfare, hooks, conversion, family, construction and low-stress longevity, with 3/6/10 rewards and persistent PBs.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/05_glassfire_ledger.jpg[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/06_lifetime_contracts.jpg[/img]

[h3]典造琉焰廷臣 / Commission a Glassfire Courtier[/h3]
游戏内金币定制廷臣：0–120 岁、六项 0–100 能力，25 教育/17 将才/38 身体/36 性格/110 其他特质；所有已载入文化与信仰及适用礼仪，卑微或玩家家族出身。成功交付才扣款；仅真人玩家，不涉及现实货币。
Commission a courtier with in-game gold: exact age/skills, 226 native traits, every loaded culture and faith with its applicable Rite, and lowborn or player-house origin. Charge only after delivery; human players only, no real-money purchase.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/08_courtier_essentials.jpg[/img]

[h3]一生一次结算 / One Life, One Settlement[/h3]
死亡逐项称量分数，跨新阈值才写纪录。有继承人确认后进入观察者；无可玩继承人由原生继承窗显示八项结算并退出主菜单。两条路径均不继续扮演后代。
Death shows exact scores and writes newly crossed record tiers. With an heir, confirmation enters observer mode; without one, the native succession window shows eight settlement values and exits to menu. Neither path plays a descendant.
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/bdc87ac77a3207945343ccdf277d6c4259bce65c/screenshots/gallery/10_death_settlement.jpg[/img]

[h1]琉焰之视 / Glassfire Gaze[/h1]
每对祝福/诅咒获 1 XP；每 10 XP 升级、增加压力获取并交替解锁重抽/封印。特质悬浮提示预览当前分数。
Each pair grants 1 XP; every 10 XP raises level and stress gain, alternating reroll/seal unlocks. The trait tooltip previews live score.

[h1]本地化与兼容性 / Localization & Compatibility[/h1]
简中 / English / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

目标 CK3 1.20.0.3；推荐新开局、单机。真实死亡纪录写入/新进程教程导入已验，无继承人完整界面及退出仍待验。覆盖同一 window_succession_event.gui 的 mod 冲突；其他同键 on_action、GUI、资源组合不作保证。
Target: CK3 1.20.0.3; new single-player games recommended. Actual death-record writing/new-process tutorial import passed; full no-heir UI and exit remain pending. Mods replacing window_succession_event.gui conflict; other same-key on_action, GUI or asset combinations are not guaranteed.

[h1]一局有多长 / Run Length[/h1]
一局就是签约统治者的一生；30–50 年通常经历约 10–17 次垂青会。/ One run is the contracted ruler's lifetime; 30–50 years usually contains about 10–17 favor sessions.

